  "description": "One API over the Ant Media WebRTC SDKs for Android, iOS and Mac Catalyst: publish and play streams with awaitable calls and ordinary .NET events, instead of writing a per-platform adapter over a Java listener interface and an Objective-C delegate. Pulls in the platform binding that matches whichever target framework you build. For .NET MAUI apps, add AntMedia.Net.Maui for the video view.",
